# r1115 phase 9, boot O2: a copy of the O1 world (1.2.02 save, level nsmfix) on the installed mods/ jars (NOSWAP=1 prep_srv).
# Rows: SQ-OB-11, SQ-RDB-05, SQ-RDX-13 (part of SQ-RDB-03), SQ-NSM-05 (server half), SQ-VH-11. Probes zz_zc4, zz_zp9.
pace 1

## SQ-OB-11 | old creativeengineering wooden buckets load as Creative Delight wooden buckets
bootexpect \[swaps\].*wooden_bucket
bootexpect \[swaps\].*wooden_water_bucket
bootreject \[swaps\] unresolved .*wooden
shell grep -nE "\[swaps\]" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "wooden|permanent|load report|unresolved" | cut -c1-260 | head -12
> forceload add 192 192 223 223
> forceload add -16 -16 63 63
sleep 4
> data get block 200 -60 205 Items
> pbot spawn ob11 205 -60 207 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 4
> data get entity ob11 Inventory
sleep 1
expect has the following block data: .*creativedelight:wooden_bucket.*creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket
expect ob11 has the following entity data: .*creativedelight:wooden_bucket.*creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket|ob11 has the following entity data: .*creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket.*creativedelight:wooden_bucket

