## SQ-RDX-13 | removed Rustic pancake and fried dough leave the chest without a crash; the old plate serves Supplementaries pancakes
> data get block 200 -60 205 Items
> pbot spawn rx13 200 -60 202 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 4
> clear rx13
> pbot hold rx13 minecraft:air
> pbot use rx13 200 -60 200 up
sleep 1
> data get entity rx13 Inventory
> zp9 bstate 200 -60 200
sleep 1
reject has the following block data: .*rusticdelight:(pancake|fried_dough)"
expect rx13 has the following entity data: .*supplementaries:pancake
look chest has no rusticdelight:pancake / fried_dough (if 1.2.02 held them); the plate gave one supplementaries:pancake and its servings went 4 -> 3

## SQ-NSM-05 | netherite lunchbox from the old save: contents intact, eat from it, dye and skin recipes match
> data get block 4 -60 0 Items
> pbot spawn n5 6 -60 2 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 4
> clear n5
> item replace entity n5 weapon.mainhand from block 4 -60 0 container.2
> zp9 held n5
waitlog \[zp9\] held n5 20
expect \[zp9\] held n5 creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox .*minecraft:bread
> zc4 hunger n5 2
> zp9 heldeat n5
waitlog \[zp9\] heldeat n5 20
> zp9 held n5
> zp9 dye n5 minecraft:red_dye
waitlog \[zp9\] dye 20
> zp9 skin n5 solapplepie:golden_lunchbox
waitlog \[zp9\] skin 20
> zp9 skin n5 fantasyfurniture:decorations/berry_basket_empty
waitlog \[zp9\] skin .*berry 20
expect \[zp9\] dye creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox \+ minecraft:red_dye recipe=
expect \[zp9\] skin creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox \+ solapplepie:golden_lunchbox recipe=
look heldeat removed one food (contents count down by one, food level up); dye result has display.color; skin results carry the skin id. Model and render are CQ (client)

## SQ-VH-11 | old save: does the Heap appear in new Nether chunks
shell ls DIM-1/region 2>/dev/null | head -3; ls nsmfix/DIM-1/region 2>/dev/null | wc -l
> execute in minecraft:the_nether positioned 3000 64 3000 run locate biome biomesoplenty:visceral_heap
waitlog (The nearest biomesoplenty:visceral_heap is at|Could not find a biome of type) 120
capture P is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run forceload add {P1} {P3}
sleep 15
> execute in minecraft:the_nether positioned {P1} 64 {P3} if biome ~ ~ ~ biomesoplenty:visceral_heap run say VH11 heap biome in a new chunk
> zq count {P1-8} 5 {P3-8} {P1+8} 120 {P3+8} biomesoplenty:flesh minecraft:the_nether
waitlog \[zq\] done 60
> zq count {P1-8} 5 {P3-8} {P1+8} 120 {P3+8} minecraft:netherrack minecraft:the_nether
waitlog \[zq\] done 60
look RECORD: locate answer and distance from 3000 3000; flesh present in the newly generated chunk
